#ASSERT NOT `protected from liability` TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `protected from liability` FALSE TRUE TRUE

§ `penalties and s 17`

#ASSERT `the maximum total fine` `holding out as operator` 3 EQUALS 130000
#ASSERT `the maximum total fine` `failing to comply with a written direction` 10 EQUALS 300000
#ASSERT `the maximum total fine` `failing to notify the operator` 5 EQUALS 20000

#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `holding out as operator` EQUALS 24
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `individual answerable, not wilfully` EQUALS 0

#ASSERT `the most the Authority may collect to compound` `failing to notify the Authority` EQUALS 100000
#ASSERT `the most the Authority may collect to compound` `giving inaccurate information carelessly` EQUALS 7500
#ASSERT `the most the Authority may collect to compound` `holding out as operator` EQUALS 50000

